---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { CANON_PATHS, LINKS } from "../lib/links";
import { withBase } from "../lib/base";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="For Brands & OEMs — Demand Store + Brand Intelligence | Betsy AI"
  description="Category sponsorships on the Betsy Demand Store and Brand Intelligence for firearms OEMs — intent-ranked shelf plus anonymized demand."
  path="/for-brands"
  ogImagePath={CANON_PATHS.tzu}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 sm:py-14">
    <p
      class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-sky-400 mb-3"
    >
      For brands
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
      Demand that manufacturers can use
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-6">
      Two doors: a public{" "}
      <strong class="text-zinc-200">Demand Store</strong> shelf ranked by live
      network intent (dealer link-outs, not your warehouse), and{" "}
      <strong class="text-zinc-200">Brand Intelligence</strong> for anonymized
      demand and search signal. Not a dump of shopper emails. Not a claim that
      you endorse us until a written deal says so.
    </p>
    <img
      src={withBase(CANON_PATHS.tzu)}
      alt="Art of Demand"
      width="960"
      height="540"
      class="mb-8 w-full rounded-2xl object-cover max-h-64 ring-1 ring-zinc-700/80"
    />

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Demand Store placements
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-4">
      Public demo at{" "}
      <a href={LINKS.store} class="text-sky-400 hover:underline"
        >2abetsy.com/store</a
      >. Not an FFL. Cards open participating dealers. Open slots:
    </p>
    <ul class="mb-8 space-y-2 text-sm text-zinc-300 list-disc pl-5">
      <li>
        <strong class="text-zinc-100">Category sponsor</strong> — badge/strip on
        a demand section (30 days)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-zinc-100">Fuel of the Demo</strong> — homepage strip
        on the store (30 days)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-zinc-100">Weekly report</strong> — logo on the public
        demand thread
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-zinc-100">Creator shelf week</strong> — co-branded
        niche shelf + UTMs
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-zinc-100">Dealer spotlight</strong> — featured when
        inventory ranks
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-8">
      Pitch in one line: we put category presence in front of people already
      mid-purchase intent — ranked by demand, closed by licensed dealers.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-10">
      <a
        href={LINKS.store}
        class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-sky-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-sky-400"
      >
        Open Demand Store →
      </a>
      <a
        href={LINKS.brandIntel}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-zinc-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100 hover:border-sky-500/60 hover:text-sky-300"
      >
        Brand Intelligence →
      </a>
      <a
        href={LINKS.pressEmail}
        class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-300 hover:border-zinc-500"
      >
        Partnerships email
      </a>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">Brand Intelligence</h2>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-6">
      Plan-gated demand and search intent for OEMs and platforms — same Betsy
      spine as dealer tools and shopper search. Built for operators who need
      signal, not theater.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-8">
      Culture, not a spec sheet:{" "}
      <a href={withBase("art-of-demand-retailbi")} class="text-sky-400 hover:underline"
        >The Fog of Sell-Through</a
      >{" "}
      — Betsy Tzu on last month’s map and the ask that never rang. Definitions
      stay on the{" "}
      <a
        href={LINKS.fortress}
        class="text-sky-400 hover:underline"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">fortress</a
      >.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600">
      Independent dealers start free on{" "}
      <a href={LINKS.gsa} class="text-sky-500 hover:underline">GunSearchAgent</a
      >. Network pulse:{" "}
      <a href={LINKS.betsyLive} class="text-sky-500 hover:underline"
        >Betsy Live</a
      >. X:{" "}
      <a href={LINKS.x} class="text-sky-500 hover:underline">@2ABetsy</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
